{"seq":2,"slug":"seccomp-apparmor","title":"Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/seccomp-apparmor","wordCount":884,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"seccomp-与-apparmor-强制约束\">Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束</h1><p>Falco 检测到容器内的异常行为后发出告警，但从告警到人工响应之间存在一个时间窗口——攻击者可以利用这段时间完成提权或数据窃取。Seccomp（Secure Computing Mode）和 AppArmor 在内核层面直接拦截危险操作：不是&quot;告诉你发生了什么&quot;，而是&quot;让它根本无法发生&quot;。即使攻击者获得了容器内的代码执行权限，如果 <code>mount</code> 系统调用被 Seccomp 禁止，容器逃逸的关键路径就被物理切断了。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Seccomp 和 AppArmor 从不同维度约束容器行为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[容器进程发起操作] --&gt; B{Seccomp 检查}&#10;    B --&gt;|系统调用被允许| C{AppArmor 检查}&#10;    B --&gt;|系统调用被禁止| D[内核返回 EPERM/SIGKILL]&#10;    C --&gt;|文件/网络访问被允许| E[操作执行]&#10;    C --&gt;|路径/能力被禁止| F[内核返回 EACCES]&#10;&#10;    G[约束维度对比] --&gt; H[Seccomp: 限制可用的系统调用]&#10;    G --&gt; I[AppArmor: 限制可访问的资源路径]&#10;    G --&gt; J[Capabilities: 限制特权操作的子集]\">graph TD\n    A[容器进程发起操作] --&gt; B{Seccomp 检查}\n    B --&gt;|系统调用被允许| C{AppArmor 检查}\n    B --&gt;|系统调用被禁止| D[内核返回 EPERM/SIGKILL]\n    C --&gt;|文件/网络访问被允许| E[操作执行]\n    C --&gt;|路径/能力被禁止| F[内核返回 EACCES]\n\n    G[约束维度对比] --&gt; H[Seccomp: 限制可用的系统调用]\n    G --&gt; I[AppArmor: 限制可访问的资源路径]\n    G --&gt; J[Capabilities: 限制特权操作的子集]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>约束维度</th>\n<th>配置方式</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Seccomp</td>\n<td>系统调用白名单/黑名单</td>\n<td>JSON profile</td>\n<td>系统调用级别</td>\n<td>极低（BPF 内核态）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AppArmor</td>\n<td>文件路径 + 网络 + capabilities</td>\n<td>文本 profile</td>\n<td>路径/能力级别</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SELinux</td>\n<td>标签化的强制访问控制</td>\n<td>策略模块</td>\n<td>对象标签级别</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Capabilities</td>\n<td>Linux 特权细分</td>\n<td>SecurityContext</td>\n<td>能力单元</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"seccomp-深度实践\">Seccomp 深度实践</h2><p>Linux 内核提供约 300+ 系统调用，但一个典型的 Web 应用实际使用的通常不超过 40-60 个。Seccomp 允许你精确指定容器可以执行哪些系统调用，其余全部禁止。</p>\n<p><strong>Kubernetes RuntimeDefault profile</strong>：自 Kubernetes 1.27 起，Pod Security Standards 的 <code>restricted</code> 级别要求使用 <code>RuntimeDefault</code> Seccomp profile。这个由容器运行时（containerd/CRI-O）维护的默认 profile 禁止约 50 个危险的系统调用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Pod&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: secure-app&#10;spec:&#10;  securityContext:&#10;    seccompProfile:&#10;      type: RuntimeDefault&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      image: myapp:v1.0&#10;      securityContext:&#10;        allowPrivilegeEscalation: false&#10;        runAsNonRoot: true&#10;        capabilities:&#10;          drop: [&#39;ALL&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">secure-app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    seccompProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">RuntimeDefault</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:v1.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        allowPrivilegeEscalation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        runAsNonRoot</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          drop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ALL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>RuntimeDefault</code> 禁止的关键系统调用包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>mount</code> / <code>umount</code>：阻止文件系统操作（容器逃逸关键路径）</li>\n<li><code>ptrace</code>：阻止进程注入和调试（凭据窃取手段）</li>\n<li><code>clone</code> with <code>CLONE_NEWUSER</code>：阻止创建新 user namespace（提权路径）</li>\n<li><code>reboot</code>：阻止关闭宿主机</li>\n<li><code>add_key</code> / <code>keyctl</code>：阻止内核密钥环操作</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>自定义严格 profile</strong>：对于行为高度可预测的应用（如 nginx 反向代理），可以生成只允许应用实际需要的系统调用的最小 profile：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;defaultAction&quot;: &quot;SCMP_ACT_ERRNO&quot;,&#10;  &quot;architectures&quot;: [&quot;SCMP_ARCH_X86_64&quot;],&#10;  &quot;syscalls&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;names&quot;: [&#10;        &quot;read&quot;,&#10;        &quot;write&quot;,&#10;        &quot;close&quot;,&#10;        &quot;fstat&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mmap&quot;,&#10;        &quot;mprotect&quot;,&#10;        &quot;brk&quot;,&#10;        &quot;epoll_wait&quot;,&#10;        &quot;accept4&quot;,&#10;        &quot;socket&quot;,&#10;        &quot;bind&quot;,&#10;        &quot;listen&quot;,&#10;        &quot;sendto&quot;,&#10;        &quot;recvfrom&quot;&#10;      ],&#10;      &quot;action&quot;: &quot;SCMP_ACT_ALLOW&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"defaultAction\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SCMP_ACT_ERRNO\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"architectures\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SCMP_ARCH_X86_64\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"syscalls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"names\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"read\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"write\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"close\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"fstat\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"mprotect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"brk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"epoll_wait\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"accept4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"socket\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"bind\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"listen\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"sendto\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        \"recvfrom\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"action\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SCMP_ACT_ALLOW\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"apparmor-文件级约束\">AppArmor 文件级约束</h2><p>AppArmor 在更高抽象层工作，控制进程可以访问哪些文件路径、网络端口和 Linux capabilities：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"# /etc/apparmor.d/container-webapp&#10;profile container-webapp flags=(attach_disconnected) {&#10;  # 允许读取应用目录&#10;  /app/** r,&#10;  /app/bin/server ix,&#10;&#10;  # 允许写入日志和临时文件&#10;  /var/log/app/** w,&#10;  /tmp/** rw,&#10;&#10;  # 禁止访问敏感路径&#10;  deny /etc/shadow r,&#10;  deny /root/** rw,&#10;  deny /proc/*/mem rw,&#10;&#10;  # 网络：仅允许 TCP 监听和出站&#10;  network tcp,&#10;  deny network raw,&#10;&#10;  # 禁止特权操作&#10;  deny capability sys_admin,&#10;  deny capability sys_ptrace,&#10;  deny mount,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># /etc/apparmor.d/container-webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>profile container-webapp flags=(attach_disconnected) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 允许读取应用目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /app/** r,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /app/bin/server ix,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 允许写入日志和临时文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /var/log/app/** w,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  /tmp/** rw,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 禁止访问敏感路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny /etc/shadow r,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny /root/** rw,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny /proc/*/mem rw,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 网络：仅允许 TCP 监听和出站</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  network tcp,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny network raw,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 禁止特权操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny capability sys_admin,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny capability sys_ptrace,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  deny mount,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 Kubernetes 中应用 AppArmor profile：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: v1&#10;kind: Pod&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;  annotations:&#10;    container.apparmor.security.beta.kubernetes.io/app: localhost/container-webapp&#10;spec:&#10;  containers:&#10;    - name: app&#10;      image: myapp:v1.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Pod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    container.apparmor.security.beta.kubernetes.io/app</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">localhost/container-webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  containers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      image</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">myapp:v1.0</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"capabilities-精细控制\">Capabilities 精细控制</h2><p>Docker 默认授予容器约 14 个 capabilities。生产环境的最佳实践是 <strong>drop ALL，add 所需</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"securityContext:&#10;  capabilities:&#10;    drop: [&#39;ALL&#39;]&#10;    add: [&#39;NET_BIND_SERVICE&#39;] # 仅在需要绑定 &lt;1024 端口时\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">securityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    drop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ALL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'NET_BIND_SERVICE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 仅在需要绑定 &#x3C;1024 端口时</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见应用的最小 capabilities 需求：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Web 服务器（非 root 监听 &gt;1024）</strong>：无额外 capabilities 需要</li>\n<li><strong>Web 服务器（监听 80/443）</strong>：<code>NET_BIND_SERVICE</code></li>\n<li><strong>网络工具（ping）</strong>：<code>NET_RAW</code>（生产环境通常不需要）</li>\n<li><strong>需要修改文件所有者</strong>：<code>CHOWN</code>、<code>FOWNER</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"profile-生成工具\">Profile 生成工具</h2><p>手动编写最小 Seccomp/AppArmor profile 既耗时又容易遗漏。推荐使用自动化工具：</p>\n<p><strong>OCI Security Profiles Operator</strong>（Kubernetes Operator）：在 audit 模式下运行应用一段时间，自动收集使用的系统调用，然后生成对应的 Seccomp profile。</p>\n<p><strong>Inspektor Gadget</strong>（eBPF 工具集）：<code>gadget audit seccomp</code> 追踪容器实际使用的系统调用，<code>gadget advise seccomp-profile</code> 生成建议的 profile。</p>\n<p>工作流：部署 → audit 模式收集（1-7 天，覆盖常见操作路径）→ 生成 profile → review → enforce → 持续监控是否有因 profile 过严导致的应用异常。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Seccomp 在系统调用层面实施白名单，<code>RuntimeDefault</code> 是生产最低基线</li>\n<li>AppArmor 在文件路径和网络层面约束访问，与 Seccomp 互补</li>\n<li><code>drop ALL</code> capabilities + 按需添加是最小权限的正确实践</li>\n<li>自动化 profile 生成工具（Security Profiles Operator）解决手动编写的成本问题</li>\n<li>Seccomp + AppArmor + Capabilities 三层叠加，构成内核级的强制隔离网</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"ebpf-observability\">eBPF 安全可观测</a>——Seccomp 阻断的同时，eBPF 提供的可见性支撑</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../devops-containerization/docker-fundamentals/container-networking\">容器网络基础</a>——理解 Seccomp 网络相关系统调用控制的底层机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Seccomp 与 AppArmor 强制约束","id":"seccomp-与-apparmor-强制约束"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Seccomp 深度实践","id":"seccomp-深度实践"},{"level":2,"text":"AppArmor 文件级约束","id":"apparmor-文件级约束"},{"level":2,"text":"Capabilities 精细控制","id":"capabilities-精细控制"},{"level":2,"text":"Profile 生成工具","id":"profile-生成工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"Falco 运行时威胁检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/falco-runtime-detection"},"next":{"title":"eBPF 安全可观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/container-security/runtime/ebpf-observability"}}